  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 8.2.3:\n\n## Added\n- GcWordDocument.Path property: Gets or sets the source file path of the document. (DOC-6318, DOC-6457)\n- GrapeCity.Documents.Word.Fields.RdFieldOptions class: Represents RD field options. (DOC-6318, DOC-6457)\n- GrapeCity.Documents.Word.Fields.TimeFormatOptions class: Represents options used to format time. (DOC-6948, DOC-6949)\n- GrapeCity.Documents.Word.Fields.DateFormatOptions class: Represents options used to format dates. (DOC-6948, DOC-6949)\n- GrapeCity.Documents.Word.Fields.TimeFieldOptions class: Represents TIME field options. (DOC-6948, DOC-6949)\n- GrapeCity.Documents.Word.Fields.DateFieldOptions class: Represents DATE field options. (DOC-6948, DOC-6949)",
